                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I absolutely love this game! It is so much fun. I love these type of food games where the further you get the more you have to do. I really feel like I am serving ice cream in space! I love that you actually run out of the products as you use them it makes it feel even more realistic. I definitely recommend this game. I can't wait to play more and see what other items and recipes I unlock! :)",
